            "review_title": "Review at Bun Cha 77 Nuoc Phan Lan",
            "review_text": "claireallured\n1 contribution\n1\nThe BEST!\nDec 2018 • Solo\nAs of now I have lived in Hanoi for 4.5 years and Bun Cha is my favorite dish...and this is my favorite Bun Cha spot hands down. The woman serving is also the most delightful and warm vendor I’ve met in Vietnam! It is so delicious here on all counts, fresh and varied salad, fresh noodles and a very generous helping of meatballs - yum! If this is not enough, the iced tea, cha da, is free! I recommend this place highly, and if that isn’t enough, my photo is hanging on the wall because she so loves her customers! Come here and you will be greeted with warm smiles, compliments and delicious food!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 13, 2018",
