            "review_title": "Review at Bun Cha 77 Nuoc Phan Lan",
            "review_text": "Giang P\n11 contributions\n0\nSuper delicious and clean!!!\nNov 2018 • Family\nSuper delicious and clean 😋. Delicious fresh meat, barbecue with Clean charcoal - No smoke - non toxic for health. The meat is crispy, no fat. Meatballs are well selected by the owner and then grinded at home so they should be very clean, this is the difference with the other restaurants. The sauce is warm and yum, very ❤️. Free ice tea 💰💰 The owner lady is always friendly. Especially, even though location is in a small street but this place is always crowded and got many famous customers and foreigners. The price is cheap!\nCan eat every week without any problems 😁😁😋\nRead more\nWritten November 24, 2018",
